    "### 5.4 The cheapest way to cut emissions by 20 percent\n",
    "\n",
    "We compare three instruments, each scaled by a root-finder until emissions are exactly 20 percent below their no-tax level:\n",
    "\n",
    "- a tax on the **bus only**,\n",
